  ('ጥምቀት', 'ethiopic', 'baptism', ARRAY['baptism', 'baptize', 'baptized']::text[], 'ጥምቀት/Timket also names the Epiphany feast (Ṭərr 11). These aliases point to passages on the sacrament/mystery of Baptism; Epiphany questions should be answered from calendar content, not from these passages.'),
